_item_assets/steam/apps/2063790/extras/a40fee9bd17f16c9c2a239039bcf6555.mp4?t=1746143472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You encounter target language speakers and <u>start to communicate</u> using basic phrases... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063790/extras/a62efdd294be21889fbb660fc6e70242.poster.avif?t=1746143472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063790/extras/a62efdd294be21889fbb660fc6e70242.webm?t=1746143472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063790/extras/a62efdd294be21889fbb660fc6e70242.mp4?t=1746143472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ability to <u>translate</u> your target language makes it possible to understand your new language... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063790/extras/8a8772db6e3acc1686f27f1b2c89b3ba.poster.avif?t=1746143472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063790/extras/8a8772db6e3acc1686f27f1b2c89b3ba.webm?t=1746143472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063790/extras/8a8772db6e3acc1686f27f1b2c89b3ba.mp4?t=1746143472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you travel through new areas, you <u>review vocabulary by battling</u> hostile creatures... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063790/extras/a7206895ab8bac81f381761a1e360099.po