 start to utilize <u>intelligent translations</u> which explain individual words in more detail... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063790/extras/04bd2842d5991dcb83db76ad0f59ea81.poster.avif?t=1746143472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063790/extras/04bd2842d5991dcb83db76ad0f59ea81.webm?t=1746143472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your new language takes you to many parts of the <u>open world</u>... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063790/extras/08e2b1476362878f3d8ec007e883bd72.poster.avif?t=1746143472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063790/extras/08e2b1476362878f3d8ec007e883bd72.webm?t=1746143472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063790/extras/08e2b1476362878f3d8ec007e883bd72.mp4?t=1746143472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ultimately, you must learn your second language to <u>defeat the Dark Crimson</u>... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063790/extras/2afb6b34d082c07e4cbfb399bff5d4fb.poster.avif?t=1746143472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063790/extras/2afb6b34d082c07e4cbfb399bff5d4fb.webm?t=1746143472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063790/extras/2afb6b34d082c07e4cbfb399bff5d4fb.m